OL,4,CFiona the hippo dies                 W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe Cincinnati Zoo in Ohio says its  W5
OL,7,Gbeloved hippopotamus Fiona has died  W5
OL,8,Gjust days after swallowing a knitted W5
OL,9,Ghat that slipped into her enclosure. W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,G"It is with extreme sadness that we  W5
OL,12,Gshare with you the devastating news  W5
OL,13,Gthat Fiona did not make it after     W5
OL,14,Gmultiple attempts from our amazing   W5
OL,15,Gvets and keeper team to help her     W5
OL,16,Gthrough what ended up being a        W5
OL,17,Gmedical emergency," the zoo said on  W5
OL,18,GThursday afternoon.                  W5
